  changing a returned state does not change the cached state.
- Prune guard: TestReplayStatePruneDropsCachedRoot asserts the pruned root was
  removed from the cache and cannot be replayed.
- Four entries cap the cache. Mainnet beacon states are hundreds of MB, so the
